# Self Audit

Canonical: `docs/process/DEFINITION_OF_DONE.md` ·
`.cursor/rules/project-handoff.mdc`

Before declaring work complete, verify silently (fix gaps; do not dump this
checklist unless asked):

- [ ] Relevant handoff / ADR / area docs consulted (not the whole tree)
- [ ] Architecture boundaries respected; no temporary hacks
- [ ] Tests added/updated and relevant suites run when code changed
- [ ] Docs updated; handoff reviewed when state changed
- [ ] No PD-023 / PD-025 / undocumented-API violations
- [ ] Quality CI expectations intact (no PR desktop builds)
- [ ] Conventional Commit / intentional paths when committing
- [ ] Completion gate: code, tests, docs, handoff, validation

Only then mark the task done.
